@dsh-extension/dsh-generation-image README · Viewing generated images：The DSH Web UI renders every generated image as a **thumbnail** in the
conversation (an assistant-side image message). Multiple images in one message
are **stacked vertically**; click any image to open the enlarged preview:

@dsh-extension/dsh-generation-image README · Local development (like vision-bridge)：From a local checkout, link it into your profile like the sibling plugins, then
restart `dsh web`:

```jsonc
// ~/.dsh/profiles/web/package.json  →  dependencies
{
  "@dsh-extension/dsh-generation-image": "link:/path/to/dsh-generation-image"
}

or, for a running instance, use the DSH super-injector:
```sh
dsh plugin inject /path/to/dsh-generation-image
```

@dsh-extension/dsh-generation-image README · Search keywords：`deepseek` · `deepseek-harness` · `dsh` · `plugin` · `image generation` ·
`text-to-image` · `image-to-image` · `img2img` · `generate image` · `gpt-image` · `OpenAI-compatible` ·
`images API` · `xiaoyaoapi` · `LLM agent`

